### ==============================================================================
### MEMBERSHIP & VOLUNTEER APPLICATION WORKFLOW APIS
### Real zero-fraud flow: User applies -> Pending -> Admin verifies payment proof -> Approved
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. User Applies for Membership (Selects Plan, Uploads Screenshot & UTR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": "PLAN_ID_HERE",
  "paymentScreenshot": "/uploads/payment_proof_123.jpg",
  "utrNumber": "UPI428198759231"
}

### 2. User Applies for Volunteer Wing (Uploads ID Proof & Skills)
POST {{baseUrl}}/volunteers/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skills": ["Event Management", "Digital Media", "Field Organizing"],
  "availability": "Weekends & Evenings",
  "idProofDocument": "/uploads/aadhaar_front_back.pdf",
  "motivation": "I want to dedicate my skills for youth empowerment and education in Aligarh."
}

### 3. Admin: List All Pending Membership Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/members?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 4. Admin: List All Pending Volunteer Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/volunteers?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 5. Admin: Approve Membership Application
### (Unlocks ID Card & Appointment Letter and emails verified credentials to applicant)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/members/MEM_APP_ID_HERE/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Admin: Reject Membership Application
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/members/MEM_APP_ID_HERE/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "UTR number does not match bank settlement records."
}

### 7. Admin: Approve Volunteer Application
### (Unlocks Volunteer badge & offer letter and auto-emails to volunteer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/volunteers/VOL_APP_ID_HERE/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Admin: Reject Volunteer Application
PUT {{baseUrl}}/applications/volunteers/VOL_APP_ID_HERE/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Submitted ID proof image is blurred."
}
